{"path":"container/flat_multimap/swap","title":"std::flat_multimap<Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::flat_multimap&lt;Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/flat_multimap/swap","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Same as underlying container (typically constant).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> flat_multimap<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\nExchanges the contents of the container adaptor with those of <code>other</code>. Effectively calls <pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>compare, other.<span class=\"me1\">compare</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c.<span class=\"me1\">keys</span>, other.<span class=\"me1\">c</span>.<span class=\"me1\">keys</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c.<span class=\"me1\">values</span>, other.<span class=\"me1\">c</span>.<span class=\"me1\">values</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> container adaptor to exchange the contents with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Same as underlying container (typically constant).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_multimap/swap2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::swap<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::flat_multimap)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  specializes the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\">std::swap</a></span> algorithm <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/flat_multimap","title":"std::flat_multimap"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::flat_multimap<Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer>::swap","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Exchanges the contents of the container adaptor with those of"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Same as underlying contain